# Byte-exact data files: never normalize line endings on checkout.
# codex_base_instructions.md is a verbatim copy of Codex's prompt.md whose
# length and hash are pinned by tests (a CRLF checkout would change both).
proxy/core/layers/codex/codex_base_instructions.md -text

# The vendored ONNX models: binary (an INT8 graph has no NUL in its first
# bytes, so the text heuristic would diff and merge it line by line).
*.onnx binary
